{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13d5_level_act13d5_05_beg","groupId":"act13d5","stageId":"act13d5_05","title":"斯沃玛视频","storyCode":"MN-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"998d69ef88d594e2e0dc3aba9a2e6d4d17e9531274e234bc6cca851bf19b9973","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔 5上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"您的是这杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啸守卫向会员提供的酒水非常丰富，真羡慕那些会员，他们能站在这里，看着骑士们的精彩表现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"您说，您是个好人，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"您犯过法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"您做过什么坏事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"不，当然，也没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"换言之，您勤勤恳恳地工作，为自己和家人赚取酬薪，您难道不是个好人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是这样，这么说，我的确是个好人，卡西米尔有很多这样的好人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，很多的好人，来，为好人们干杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，干杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"您说，如果有人要剥夺好人的工作，剥夺好人生活的办法，这种人，还能是好人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"连乡野农夫在农活结束之后，都会以收看附近城邦的骑士竞技转播为乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"数十万......甚至是上百万产业相关的卡西米尔人都靠着骑士竞技而活，他们大都是些好人啊，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"您说的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"假如有一天，骑士竞技消失了......企业一夜之间消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"谁来为征战骑士们提供年年增长的军费，谁为卡西米尔争取经济地位以遏制外敌的侵略？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您说，那些反对者，是坏人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"您是个好人，他们要剥夺您的生活，为他们古老的“荣誉”加冕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"同样是靠他人铺设道路，至少我们给了大部分人——甚至是感染者——活下去的机会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"那些“坏人们”，则为了他们微不足道的自我安慰，将国家和国民的利益置之不顾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您是个好人，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是临光最常光顾的酒吧吗，哇塞，真有卡西米尔的风格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老板！今天玛莉娅·临光会来这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"这就要看你们的运气了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"最近生意兴隆啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"托玛莉娅的福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次这么多人得是什么时候了？佐菲娅那时候吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是“骑士”啊，这其中的大部分人都是慕名而来的，真不知道是哪家媒体报道的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"有钱赚你还不乐意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是想让她俩有个安安静静放松的地方嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，马丁，在这张座位上刻个字，“科瓦尔专属”，我可不想下次过来还要等位子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"付一笔冠名费，我就同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"呿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，喂，临光真的来了！本人哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快，别放过这个机会，去要张合影！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，谢谢、谢谢......合影？我吗？抱歉，我现在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，都让一让——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等......你是佐菲娅！是“鞭刃”佐菲娅！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，传言是真的！“鞭刃”佐菲娅真的是小临光的教练！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"佐菲娅小姐！我看过你的比赛，我深受感动！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，好，完蛋。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（姑、姑母！快想想办法！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅，我爱你啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，要打架出去打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，在这里打架是老东西的特权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——科瓦尔师傅！弗格瓦尔德师傅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"请各位客人注意了，为了庆祝本店两位老顾客的优秀表现，今天的消费一律八折起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"请各位立刻回到座位上点单！每种酒水小食限量销售，售罄为止！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打折？还有这种好事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等......等等......那个光头大叔，难道是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"只是老马丁而已，好了，要点什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"马丁......？真的是“颤铁”马丁......呜呜呜......今天真的太值了......给我一杯“马丁特调”......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"总、总算......我从没见过这里这么热闹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢啦，马丁叔，回头亏损我会帮你补上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，“打八折”就想让我的酒吧亏钱，那也太小看老马丁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......来这手啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么了，还能不能喝了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"人都走光了，你、你还和谁喝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"我——呕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"别在这儿吐——要吐出去吐——欸！你这老东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"你们聊正事吧，到打烊的时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打烊之后，就变成我们包场了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，打烊后才是这座小酒吧正式营业的时间啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅......就结果而言，你现在的积分已经够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"连战连胜，简直不可思议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"有、有侥幸的成分在里面啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要保持这样的成绩，就这么固守分数到季后，才是最好的打算......不过我担心的是别的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姑母？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":".......玛莉娅，下一场是竞速赛，竞速赛的积分变动比较微小，就当是巩固胜算吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这之后，不要再参加任何比赛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但是就这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经够了，胜券在握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也看到了......玛莉娅，现在已经有很多人关注你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要保持这样的步调，等待积分结算，你就可以赢得骑士封号，我们的目的就达到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吗？听姐姐的，这是最好的结果——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"可这样......这样没有任何变化......如果我不继续前进，这样根本改变不了临光家的现状......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"玛恩纳叔叔也一定不会认可这种行为的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛恩纳那个顽固的家伙，不管你做什么他都不会认同你的，你不是最清楚了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想那么多好吗？玛莉娅......这样就是最好的，见好就收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姑母......发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道骑士竞技到底意味着什么......你不知道接下来到底会遇见什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姑母！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在竞技场里，没有一场胜利是属于骑士的，胜利，只属于卡西米尔，属于......企业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的不想和他们合作，那一开始就不该参加骑士竞赛，如果我们还要走这条路......玛莉娅，要适可而止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"佐菲娅，你知道了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那个斯沃特的员工告诉我了一些内部传闻。玛莉娅的人气让她比其他选手更早一步进入了骑士协会上层的视野......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅如果不在合适的地方停下，他们会有动作的，不管是什么手段，都不是我们该去承担的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，玛莉娅，听姐姐的，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不明白......如果不想被他们操纵就意味着要向他们低头，这又有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅！这可不是开玩笑的——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会死在赛场上的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......“焰尾”也说过，我没有看清骑士竞技到底意味着什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我真的不知道她说的那些残酷的部分......但是，我也不是抱着随便的心态参赛的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"受伤也好，意外也好，甚至是牺牲——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱歉，姑母，我不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这根本不是“牺牲”，我也不想看着你因为这种原因有什么意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你抱着这样的心态，你更该适可而止！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不觉得我该停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕没有入围特锦赛，哪怕止步在目标之前，自己的事业就应该自己奋斗......我应该一直赢到赢不下去为止！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姑母......!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确信你不该继续参赛。因为你错估了骑士竞技背后的一切，你更不明白......当年玛嘉烈的行为，究竟有多惊世骇俗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果卡西米尔真的是个公平的国度，你说的也许都对。但事与愿违，傻子都看得出来这些规则有多隐晦，打破规则又有多么儿戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还只是个没有封号也没有所属的独立骑士，玛莉娅，我可以向骑士协会提出申请暂停你的比赛进程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......姑母！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点，玛莉娅，也让佐菲娅冷静一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"她是为了你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"但佐菲娅说的没错，竞技骑士的胜利从来都是身不由己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"企业只是给了“临光家的新骑士”一个生根发芽的机会，等到了需要收割的时候，他们自然会拿着镰刀出现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士只有“申请赛事”的权利......除了特锦赛之外，一切赛制和结果都掌握在企业手里，骑士几乎没有选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真像佐菲娅所说，有企业内部的声音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"也许的确有一些信号，我们都该重视起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......怎么了？刚才好像看见佐菲娅冲出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"丫头怎么这幅脸色？不是赢了吗？赢了还要吵架？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"你俩就别掺和了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......我、我先回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"之后还有一场竞速赛，要做好装备的检修......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅&白金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（好漂亮的人，但是一股血的味道......是骑士吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（玛莉娅·临光，真年轻......比资料里看上去还要年轻。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅&白金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（可惜啊。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_204_platnm","aliases":["白金"]}]}
